{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Aisi deewangi dekhi nahin kahin,        [A]Maine......... [G#]iss liye.
[C#m] .... [G#]Ahhhh [C#m]aahhh...        [C#m]jaane jaa [B]na, deewa [C#m]na
Tera [C#m]naam rakh diya,        tera [G#]naam rakh di [C#m]ya
Haan, [C#m]naam rakh diya,        tera [G#]naam rakh di [C#m]ya
Tune [C#m]pehli nazar mein sanam,        mere [G#]dil ko churaa [C#m]ya
Oye, duniya se paraayi,        tujhe [G#]apna banaa [C#m]ya
Bina [G#]dekhe tu [F#]jhe ab,        na [A]aaye qa [C#m]raar
Har gha [G#]di hai mu [F#]jhe ab,        te [F#m]ra inte [C#m]zaar
[C#m]Teri chahat ki chandi
[G#]meri aankho [C#m]mein bas gayi
[C#m]Yeh khushbu tere jism ki
[G#]meri sanso [C#m]me bas gayi
[G#]Too [F#]meri aarsu [A]too hai [C#m]meri wafa
[C#m]Jindagi [F#]me kabhi [A]abb naa [C#m]honge juda
